; Was 0.3 (byte-identical to A1 stock, never re-derived for devq) until
; found to mismatch megadog_world.sdf's actual simulated ground friction
; (mu=1.0) by >3x - see MegadogController.cpp's kStandingJointTargetRad
; comment (attempt 5) for the investigation and outcome. 0.5 stays
; comfortably under the sim's real mu=1.0. Must be kept in lock-step with
; makeDevqWbcConfig()'s friction_coefficient (also 0.5) - the WBC's own
; friction cone task and the NMPC's belief here must agree.
frictionConeSoftConstraint
{
  frictionCoefficient    0.5

  ; relaxed log barrier parameters
  mu                     0.1
  delta                  5.0
}

